## Context: One test result; ID is a stable technical label and status is translated separately. Temporary native support/piston experiment; remove after review.
lothlorien.message.probe.result=Support test %s: %s
## Context: A test met its expected outcome. Temporary native support/piston experiment; remove after review.
lothlorien.message.probe.pass=passed
## Context: A test failed; developer details are in the Content Log. Temporary native support/piston experiment; remove after review.
lothlorien.message.probe.fail=failed; see Content Log
## Context: Rejects concurrent runs of a test rig. Temporary native support/piston experiment; remove after review.
